<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n106911" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπαν-οίγω</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπαν-οίγνυμι</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>open from below, tap</i> a cask, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βῖκος ὑπανεῴγνυτο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ephipp.
					8.2
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hermipp.
				82.7
			</span></i> (hex.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>open underhand</i> or <i>secretly,</i> [
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γράμματα] ὑπανέῳγεν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					32.28
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ δωμάτιον ὑπανοίξασα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Asin.</u>
					13
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> intr.,
				<i>open underneath,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄντρον ὑπανοίγει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					J.
					<u>BJ</u>
					1.21.3
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
